<project>
  <fileVersion>
    <major>6</major>
    <minor>9</minor>
    <build>0</build>
  </fileVersion>
  <title>TurboExo ADS1115 sensor interface - Rev A / low-voltage bench build</title>
  <author>TurboExo</author>
  <description>30x24 individual-pad perfboard. Coordinates are TOP view (column,row), 2.54mm pitch. All colored wires are INSULATED underside jumpers: solder endpoints only; crossings and bends are not connections. Socket U1 and R1. R1=1k bench candidate; leave R3 sockets EMPTY and J3 unplugged until oil-temperature sender is identified. Not 12V tolerant or automotive-transient-qualified. See companion soldering guide and wiring manifest. Do not connect ECU oil-pressure sensor to J3.</description>
  <width value="170.0" unit="mm"/>
  <height value="110.0" unit="mm"/>
  <gridSpacing value="0.1" unit="in"/>
